# UX / UI Style Rules

## Core UX Principles

- Linear flow only (no forks)
- Immediate feedback after actions
- No configuration-heavy UI
- User should NEVER wonder "what to do next"

## UI Constraints

- Use simple, readable layouts
- Prefer vertical flow over dashboards
- Avoid dense information screens

## AI Result Presentation

AI results MUST:
- Appear only in Post Detail page
- Be visually separated from original text
- Be clearly labeled as "AI Generated"

AI results MUST NOT:
- Look like chat messages
- Be editable by default
- Be regenerated automatically

## Phase 2 UX Elements

Allowed:
- Disabled buttons
- Hint text
- "Coming Soon" sections

Forbidden:
- Interactive but non-functional components
- Fake data visualizations
